<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Pernod Ricard.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Pernod Ricard.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. New York has issued five million American-style call warrants in two equal tranches, on Pernod Ricard stock, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   28.OCT.96	   LISTING	  PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000		  SPOT REFERENCE  284.00 FRF</p>
<p>+  +  +  +  +  +</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE    MATURITY   PRICE     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL  A     300	 17.DEC.97  2.65 FRF  14.96 PCT 10.7 X</p>
<p> CALL  B     350	 17.DEC.99  3.10 FRF  34.15 PCT 9.2 X</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
